<!--
    Jejak's mark: the Mochiy "j" with a three-dot trail running into its hook,
    from section 1d of the F0 design. The glyph is outlined straight from
    Mochiy Pop One, as the design note asks, rather than redrawn by hand.

    The design is an iOS tile where the mark bleeds to the edges. Android masks
    an adaptive icon to a 72dp shape, and this mark runs corner to corner on the
    diagonal, so it is sized by its smallest enclosing circle and centred on it:
    the largest placement that survives a circular mask whole, with a little air
    left so it does not kiss the edge.
-->
